            "\"within Agbani Judicial Division\"); the Offence itself in ordinary, specific language (s.36(12) CFRN; Aoko v Fagbemi) - and where the offence has specific elements, these must be pleaded: housebreaking/burglary (state day or night), defilement/rape (state the victim's age), murder (name the victim and the weapon/method - e.g.",
